This project is an independent profile and plugin collection for DeepSeek Harness.
It is not an official DeepSeek release.

DeepSeek Harness is Copyright DeepSeek and is distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

Release builds also bundle the Google Workspace CLI 0.22.5 (Apache-2.0) and
GitHub MCP Server 1.9.0 (MIT). Their upstream LICENSE files are included beside
the binaries in each desktop application.

Release builds include @anionex/dsh-vision-toolkit 0.1.32 (MIT), which packages
a pinned adapter of Anionex/agent-vision-toolkit. Its package license and
upstream attribution files are distributed with the installed dependency.
